### 🚫 EXPLICIT DESIGN ANTI-PATTERNS:
**Colors to NEVER use:**
- Dark navy headers (#1C2536)  
- Corporate blue palette (#303F9F, #7681E8)
- Enterprise green (#43A047)
- Corporate gray text (#3D4759)

**Typography to NEVER use:**
- SF Pro Text font family
- Enterprise font weights (Semibold 20px/30px)
- Corporate typography scales

**Layout patterns to NEVER use:**
- Dark navy top headers
- 4-column metric card grids
- Enterprise dashboard layouts
- Fixed header navigation
- Corporate spacing patterns (24px enterprise units)

**Component patterns to NEVER use:**
- Joveo-prefixed components (JoveoButton, JoveoCard, etc.)
- Enterprise metric cards with specific chart integration
- Corporate data table patterns
- Brand-compliant chart color palettes
- Enterprise shadow/elevation patterns

## 🚫 AVOID FOR RAPID DEVELOPMENT

- Complex state management (Redux, Zustand) for simple apps
- Over-abstracted component hierarchies
- Extensive type definitions for prototypes
- Complex testing setups
- Performance optimizations before they're needed
- Over-engineered folder structures
- Complex form validation libraries for simple forms
- Micro-components for every UI element

## 📝 REMEMBER

- **Working code > Perfect code**
- **Ship features > Architect abstractions** 
- **Iterate quickly > Plan extensively**
- **Copy patterns > Reinvent wheels**
- **Solve problems > Follow best practices**

